OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow 2026 generated #233m - is
OL,4,Ait a blueprint for future games?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a million people attended the
OL,7,FCommonwealth Games in Glasgow this
OL,8,Fsummer, and 510 million sports fans
OL,9,Fwatched from around the world,
OL,10,Faccording to a new report.
OL,12,FThe Glasgow 2026 impact evaluation also
OL,13,Ffound that it generated #233m in
OL,14,Feconomic activity across Scotland, with
OL,15,F#158.6m of that in the host city
OL,16,Fitself.
OL,18,FGlasgow stepped in to host a
OL,19,Fscaled-down version of the event, which
OL,20,Ffeatured fewer sports and athletes,
OL,21,Fafter the Australian state of Victoria
OL,22,Fpulled out due to rising costs in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
