OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow 2026 generated #233m - is
OL,4,Ait a blueprint for future games?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers promised it would cost the
OL,7,Ftaxpayer nothing and the figures in the
OL,8,Fnew report show they achieved this.
